The three-tier layering of bisos.capability. CBM at the top --- one cbmProc.spcs per capability leaf, a thin pointer + gate + audit log. CBS in the middle --- one -cbs.pcs executable per capability, the actual specification content. CBA at the bottom --- the shared framework in this pip package. The load-bearing arrow from CBM to CBS is a subprocess.run call: CBM sits on top of CBS via subprocess dispatch and does NOT duplicate CBS content.
